<title>PHILIPPINES: Belle to hike capital to 20 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Belle to hike capital to 20 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming concern Belle Corp said on Thursday its board approved the increase in the company's authorised capital stock to 20 billion pesos from 4 billion pesos.</p>
<p>It also cleared the creation of preferred shares. The initial issuance to the increase in capital shall be made through the issuance of non-voting, non-convertible preferred shares with a par value of one peso through a private placement, the company said.</p>
</text>
